Z||000007||Songman||07-22-2001||02:49 PM||||My mom bought a Chuck Berry and Friends three album set from K-tel off of the TV back in the 70s! Can't say that it was a miracle but it introduced me to some pretty cool music I wouldn't have known otherwise. I still have it!<P>Whenever I have the time, I like to go to the huge Nashville Flea Market that is held the last weekend of every month. It is one of the biggest in the country and fantastic! There is a guy there that has a whole bunch of As Seen On TV stuff at great deals! I'm going next weekend and plan to buy one of those magnetic miracle dusters. I think they are $19.99 on TV and he has them for $9.99 and you get the small size one for free.<P>My girlfriend buys all of these miracle diet and workout things from the TV. We have tons of that stuff sitting around that she never touches once it gets here....<P>------------------<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/songman_1.gif"> <BR><A HREF="http://members.home.com/tnfieros" TARGET=_blank>Tennessee Fiero Owners</A>||||reg||1
Z||000008||banditbalz||07-22-2001||09:28 PM||||For the last 7 years I have been using "Liquid Lustre" the car wax. I thought it was the Cat's ass until today. Bought a bottle of 3M High Gloss wax and it loks like new paint... I only had to use Liquid Lustre twice a year. stuff works great. Removes crap like tar and bugs too.<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/ColdOne_1.jpg"> <P>------------------<BR>Silver 86 GT<BR>completely stock,<BR>completely fast!||||reg||1
